    <p><span class="core-mark">Strongest-core profile</span><strong><b>1.08 D</b><small>upper crossing</small></strong></p>
    <p><span class="threshold-mark">Example threshold</span><strong><b>0.55</b><small>sink / w*</small></strong></p>
  </div>
  <div class="profile-chart" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable normalized updraft-profile chart">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 520 430" role="img" aria-label="Updraft profiles by relative boundary-layer height, showing the core curve crossing a sink threshold higher than the average curve">
